{"id":"anaxatir","qid":"Q1076875","category":"river","type":"hydronym","names":{"az":"Anaxatır","ru":"Храми","en":"Khrami River"},"coordinates":[45.12528,41.31528],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"qazax-tovuz","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q389381","az":"Qazax rayonu","en":"Gazakh District"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Anaxatır və ya Xram (gürc. ხრამი (Xrami)) — Gürcüstan və Azərbaycanda çay. Kür çayının sağ qolu. Başlanğıcını Kiçik Qafqaz dağlarının Ərcivan dağ silsiləsinin Gürcüstan Respublikasının Samtsxe-Cavaxeti mxaresinin Borjomi bələdiyyəsi ərazisində yerləşən Tsxratskaro dağ keçidinin (2 454.3 m) ətəyindən, 2 422 m hündürlükdən götürür. Çayın illik orta su sərfi 1 km³/san-dir.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Хра́ми (Кци́а; устар. Храм, Кция, груз. ხრამი, азерб. Anaxatır) — река в восточной части Грузии и частично западной части Азербайджана, правый приток Куры.\nДлина реки 201 км, площадь бассейна 8340 км², высота над уровнем моря истока — 2422 м, средний расход воды — 51,7 м³/с, максимальный расход воды — 1260 м³/с.\nОсновные притоки — Дебед (река), Кледеисицкали, Акалафисцкалли, Торне.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"The Khrami (Georgian: ხრამი) or Anakhatir (Azerbaijani: Anaxatır), in its upper course Ktsia, is a river in eastern Georgia and western Azerbaijan, and a right tributary of the Kura (Mtkvari). It is 201 km (125 mi) long, and has a drainage basin of 8,340 km2 (3,220 sq mi). The Khrami originates in the Trialeti Range and flows into a deep valley. It is fed primarily by snow melt. Its main tributaries are the Debed (left) and Mashavera (right) rivers.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/Khrami_River_Kirach_Muganlo.jpg/960px-Khrami_River_Kirach_Muganlo.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/Khrami_River_Kirach_Muganlo.jpg/960px-Khrami_River_Kirach_Muganlo.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":508,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Khrami_River_Kirach_Muganlo.jpg","title":"Khrami River Kirach Muganlo.jpg","artist":"SibFreak","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q1076875: Khrami River","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1076875","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Anaxatır","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Anaxat%C4%B1r&oldid=8832258","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anaxat%C4%B1r","revid":8832258,"revDate":"2026-04-24","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Храми","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%A5%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B8&oldid=149267970","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A5%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B8","revid":149267970,"revDate":"2025-10-20","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Khrami","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Khrami&oldid=1374514305","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khrami","revid":1374514305,"revDate":"2026-09-12","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Khrami River Kirach Muganlo.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Khrami_River_Kirach_Muganlo.jpg","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"review"}